    "description": "The Horizon Blue app makes it easy to access your health plan information. Plus you can find care and connect with Horizon member services. The app is intended for use by Horizon members. Horizon Blue Cross Blue Shield of New Jersey is an independent licensee of the Blue Cross Blue Shield Association.\r\nThe Horizon Blue app is free and lets you:\r\n\u2022 View your benefits and coverage details.\r\n\u2022 Visit with a doctor\r\n\u2022 View, download and share your ID card\r\n\u2022 Find in-network doctors, hospitals and other health care professionals  \r\n\u2022 Track your out-of-pocket costs\r\n\u2022 Submit medical claims",
